          "stage2_correction": {
            "pair": "፲፮ -> ፲፰",
            "reason": "The cross-reference for the calling of Simon and Andrew by the Sea of Galilee is Matthew 4:18 (ማቴ ፬ ፲፰), and the printed numeral clearly shows the two vertical chambers of ፰ (8) rather than ፮ (6)."
